   "SecondaryAttribute": "Planning Pick your slots Next, you mark for each one-hour slot whether you can make it and in wha...",
   "TertiaryAttribute": null,
   "Payload": {
    "QuestionText": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e1e8;border-left:6px solid #0f766e;border-radius:6px;padding:20px 22px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2a37;line-height:1.6\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e\">Planning</div><h2 style=\"font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:6px 0 10px;color:#1f2a37\">Pick your slots</h2><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#55606e\">Next, you mark for each one-hour slot whether you can make it and in what way. First you sign in with your work account, so we know who answered. All times are UTC.</div></div>",
